stateDiagram-v2
    %% BlockBug Bug State-Transition Model

    [*] --> Open: Bug report created

    state "Open" as Open
    state "In Progress" as InProgress
    state "Resolved" as Resolved
    state "Closed" as Closed

    Open --> InProgress: Start work<br/>Assigned Developer
    InProgress --> Resolved: Mark fix ready<br/>Assigned Developer
    Resolved --> Closed: Verify fix<br/>Assigned or Reporting Tester
    Resolved --> InProgress: Reject fix<br/>Assigned or Reporting Tester

    Closed --> [*]: Bug lifecycle completed

    note right of Open
        Awaiting development work
    end note

    note right of InProgress
        Fix is being implemented
    end note

    note right of Resolved
        Fix is ready for tester verification
    end note

    note right of Closed
        Fix has been verified
    end note
